 .Enter Configuration ?    -  To change screen formatting, etc:
 .Enter File                  (must be in a directory room)
 .Enter Xmodem File        -  Upload using Xmodem
 .Enter Ymodem File        -  Upload using Ymodem
 .Enter Zmodem File        -  Upload using Zmodem
 .Enter Kermit File        -  Upload using Kermit
                              (See .Help FILES for more info)
 .Enter Zmodem File        -  Upload using Zmodem
 .Enter Message            -  To enter a message:
 .Enter Xmodem Message     -  To enter a message using Xmodem protocol
 .Enter Ymodem Message     -  To enter a message using Ymodem protocol
 .Enter Zmodem Message     -  To enter a message using Zmodem protocol
 .Enter Kmodem Message     -  To enter a message using Kermit protocol
 .Enter Password           -  To change password
 .Enter Room               -  To create a new room
 .Enter Held-Message       -  To continue helded message
 .Enter Net-Message        -  To enter a net message
 .Enter Xmodem Net-Message -  To enter a net message using XMODEM protocol
 .Enter Ymodem Net-Message -  To enter a net message using YMODEM protocol
 .Enter Zmodem Net-Message -  To enter a net message using ZMODEM protocol
 .Enter Kermit Net-Message -  To enter a net message using Kermit protocol
                              (see .Help protocol for more info)

